      "worked_solution": "Since the matrix of the quadratic form must be symmetric, we rewrite our expression as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14167787/assets/38d71b4d0e2e6e4e271e04889292fc77209655fd96accd7ab94358839527c381.svg)\n\nNotice that to get a symmetric matrix, we must do the following splits:\n\n- we split the coefficient of ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14167787/assets/3cd51b9ca52bf7654f66792b03bd448a08b1122b07fb9028abf3cf9eb317691e.svg) between the entries ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14167787/assets/041786e547d7190e7dc272dcce677ae110c98a1c27601d701527c08a27ce069f.svg) and\n\n- we split the coefficient of ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14167787/assets/824c1904e6a2dbe749c4a8c6dba76e5f1f3470e44c549f9fe472f11b871b1fe5.svg) between the entries ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14167787/assets/e2035cd0dc43c754085c2be1daf4394ebe91d59706bc609c2398323dc160edee.svg)\n\nSo, the matrix corresponding to our quadratic form is\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14167787/assets/ffc81faf6d2f06bbe8d74cd6b8fc69e9cd1d38a330f492bf925441633ca283e5.svg)\n\nTherefore, ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14167787/assets/5db60b1276b1838de62d9a1fa07bdb79930a293720bc5e88ab3113863282afeb.svg) ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14167787/assets/af43e412255aa69feb8f127bcba2b8aa43eb5d5efb12d692f4f4e2d49c035a98.svg) and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14167787/assets/187bf10c65391a58d6b69f746f7f2c4cf2939b3beacfc02c15cef309875c3b57.svg) Finally, \n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14167787/assets/af56151e2bfb52d48f7b45d954f8c91cbaa1831fe024245667f4f4d721c87e6f.svg)",
